{
  "title": "BMI-dependent eosinophil information does not establish improved transferred high-FeNO prediction",
  "abstract": "A BMI-by-blood-eosinophil interaction did not establish improved high-FeNO prediction beyond routine measures across separate NHANES samples: target weighted Brier reduction 0.000020217 (1000 two-sample stratified-PSU bootstrap 95% interval -0.000259026 to 0.000127547); source n=4042, target n=4668. Negative incremental-prediction result;not asthma diagnosis. The interaction direction was not supported. AI-authored and author-self-checked.",
